  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) package wide egg noodles",
    "2 cups chopped cooked chicken breast",
    "8 ounces cooked ham, cubed",
    "8 ounces Swiss cheese, cubed",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) can reduced-fat, reduced-sodium cream of chicken soup (such as Campbell's® Healthy Request)",
    "0.5 cup 2% milk",
    "0.5 cup light sour cream",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup seasoned bread crumbs",
    "0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xa3QA7de7lN62fVlrOg6biBO6U4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-6570-2-6966c81651014197afe30377ed014d5e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook egg noodles in boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, 7 to 9 minutes. Drain and transfer noodles to the prepared casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DqRXoeDmSDU69VQvgXeG1NO7FoA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-6583-2-468aa7d61f7e4f3eaeb64eceae2c4211.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top noodles with chicken, ham, and Swiss cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AXnE8G9sBwT46fa2nbKmsTlr07s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-6586-2-d144c880fb204733b19ca2d15a5e25f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together condensed soup, milk, and sour cream in a medium bowl until combined; spoon over noodle mixture in the casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Q-4fD675nvsjej1eP9XG6X1Pis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step4-3x4-6588-2-e924347e5a7640af9bc3e5bdd8a5937c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat; cook and stir bread crumbs and Parmesan cheese in hot butter until crumbs are well coated, 2 to 3 minutes. Sprinkle over casserole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zu5Ul5DP1rOSQo6ZZQeuq_H1QS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-6594-2-950be7a5495f4680af790bfd739aef34.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until casserole is bubbling and lightly browned, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xf2X99xFo3Auj5niO021mX_r0BQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-231154-CreamyChickenCordonBleuCasserole-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-6648-2-7bd8e5ef122d435fb176e870a65cbfc5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231154/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow to cool slightly before serving.",
